<title>USA: Horseshoe Gaming sells $160 mln in 10-yr 144A debt.</title>
<headline>Horseshoe Gaming sells $160 mln in 10-yr 144A debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Horseshoe Gaming LLC was priced late on Wednesday via sole manager Wasserstein Perella Securities (Grantchester Securities), said a source close to the deal.</p>
<p>Horseshoe Gaming operates casinos in Bossier City, Louisiana, and Tunica, Mississippi.</p>
<p>BORROWER HORSESHOE GAMING LLC</p>
<p>AMT $160 MLN	 COUPON 9.375 PCT  MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.899  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 9.39 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 300 BPS    CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
